   Kainana S. and Giardina, Christian P. and Louis, Renee Pualani and
   McMillen, Heather and Asing, C. Kala and Asing, Kayla and Block, Tabetha
   A. and Browning, Mililani and Camara, Kualii and Camara, Lahela and
   Dudley, Melanie Leila and Frazier, Monika and Gomes, Noah and Gordon,
   Amy Elizabeth and Gordon, Marc and Heu, Linnea and Irvine, Aliah and
   Kaawa, Nohea and Kirkpatrick, Sean and Leucht, Emily and Perry, Cheyenne
